            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[### Changed
- **The usage bars now use the full width of the panel.** They were a fixed width
  with empty space to their right; each bar is about 30% longer now, so small
  differences between them are easier to see. Everything still lines up column to
  column, and a reset time that would have been clipped shrinks to fit instead.
]]></description>
